<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.header {
  height: 60pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 15pt 35pt;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 24pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  padding: 15pt 35pt 45pt 35pt;
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  gap: 18pt;
}
.left {
  flex: 1.2;
}
.right {
  flex: 1;
}
.section {
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
h2 {
  font-size: 11pt;
  color: #D4AF37;
  margin: 0 0 3pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 16pt;
  font-size: 8pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.chart-box {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 6pt;
  padding: 10pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 5pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-box h3 {
  font-size: 12pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 6pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>宏观环境：复苏与分化并存</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="left">
    <div class="section">
      <h2>📈 全球视角</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>美联储降息周期开启</li>
        <li>新兴市场资金回流</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="section">
      <h2>🏛️ 国内视角</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>财政货币政策协同发力</li>
        <li>消费投资双轮驱动</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="section">
      <h2>📊 关键指标</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>GDP目标增长5%</li>
        <li>CPI温和回升至2.5%</li>
        <li>M2增速8-9%</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="chart-box" id="macro-chart" class="placeholder" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
